# 界面文本（screen_pick）。键名为“screen_pick-”加上取自英文的简短名称，工具提示的键名以 -tip 结尾。

screen_pick-pick-screen-color = 截取屏幕颜色
screen_pick-hide-window-and-pick-screen = 隐藏窗口并截取屏幕颜色
screen_pick-screen-color-picking-is-available = 截取屏幕颜色仅支持 Windows
screen_pick-screen-capture-unavailable = 无法截取屏幕
screen_pick-screen-color-picker-unavailable = 无法启动屏幕取色
screen_pick-screen-capture-size-limit-exceeded = 屏幕大小超过截取上限
